{"title":"New York mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#New_York_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">New York middle school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#New_York_high_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">New York high school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#New_York_college_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">New York college mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#National_math_contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National math contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"New_York_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\">New York middle school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: New York middle school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=532\">middle school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_MathCounts\" title=\"New York MathCounts\">New York MathCounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"New_York_high_school_mathematics_competitions\">New York high school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: New York high school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=214\">high school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Nassau_County_Interscholastic_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Nassau County Interscholastic Math League (page does not exist)\">Nassau County Interscholastic Math League</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://nciml.com/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_City_Interscholastic_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"New York City Interscholastic Math League (page does not exist)\">New York City Interscholastic Math League</a> (NYCIML) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nyciml.org/\">website</a>, which is also open to schools outside of New York City</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_State_Math_League\" title=\"New York State Math League\">New York State Math League</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://nysml.com/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Queens_College_Math_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Queens College Math Competition (page does not exist)\">Queens College Math Competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Downtown_Mathematics_Invitational&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Downtown Mathematics Invitational (page does not exist)\">Downtown Mathematics Invitational</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://dmi.stuy.edu/home\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trinity_Math_Competition(TrinMaC)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Trinity Math Competition(TrinMaC) (page does not exist)\">Trinity Math Competition(TrinMaC)</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/trinmac-nyc/trinmac-virtual/info?authuser=0\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"New_York_college_mathematics_competitions\">New York college mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: New York college mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_State_Mathematics_Association_of_Two-Year_Colleges&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"New York State Mathematics Association of Two-Year Colleges (page does not exist)\">New York State Mathematics Association of Two-Year Colleges</a> (NYSMATYC) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nysmatyc.org/league/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_math_contests\">National math contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: National math contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Mathematics competitions resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time